# RoyalRushKeyBox (31455), the key box a sepulcher room leaves. The first action selects it;
# the talk gives the character one Sepulcher Key (7260) and takes the box out of the world,
# showing no page: the action's ActionFailed, the key's message, the ActionFailed of the
# selection the box's leaving clears, and the empty first talk's. Its minute-54 removal reads the local clock, so
# tests/ai/royal_rush_rooms_test.go covers it, with the charms and the trigger boxes.
character Hunter 20
item 7260
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.RoyalRushDefaultNpc.RoyalRushDefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.RoyalRushDefaultNpc.RoyalRushKeyBox
npc box 31455 Folk 40 0 0

action box
action box
  S ActionFailed
  S SystemMessage id=54 3:7260
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  items 7260=1
